[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3]

; NOT CONTENT. A neutral technical fixture for the room-contract
; conformance suite (`make godot-room-contract`). It is a complete
; authored room -- floor, four walls, ceiling, two cut doorways and a
; balcony -- built to the declarations in `room_contract_driver.gd`, so
; the authored producer can be measured by exactly the checks the
; procedural producer is measured by. No shipped manifest references it.
;
; 12 x 6 x 16 m, and every wall is INSIDE that: the outer faces sit on
; the declared envelope, which is what lets two rooms butt together
; without sharing a wall or overlapping. `ShellValidator` measures it.
; Floor top y=0, ceiling underside y=5.5, balcony top y=3.0 over
; x [-5.6,-1.6], z [8.2,13.8] -- high enough that the floor beneath it
; keeps a player's 2.4 m of headroom, the number `ElevationBand`
; validates at parse.
; This one tells the truth. It is the reference the other two lie
; against, and all three carry the IDENTICAL manifest.

